          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/49680340021915-How-to-launch-Customer-Agent-on-WhatsApp#before-you-begin",
          "text": "Before you begin"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/49680340021915-How-to-launch-Customer-Agent-on-WhatsApp#how-whatsapp-differs-from-other-channels",
          "text": "How WhatsApp differs from other channels"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/49680340021915-How-to-launch-Customer-Agent-on-WhatsApp#set-it-up",
          "text": "Set it up"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/49680340021915-How-to-launch-Customer-Agent-on-WhatsApp#template-messages",
          "text": "Template messages"
